A quiet registry hall welcomes travelers arriving in northern Midgaard. Shelves of city maps, copied notices, and old route ledgers line the walls beside simple benches for weary newcomers. A wayfarer's rune-stone rests here for those traveling farther afield, while the great temple lies just to the east.
